    "name": "DoSelect JSON Server",
    "description": "Coverage includes all dataset list routes, item lookups where records have IDs, reusable CRUD methods, and representative JSON Server filter/search/sort/pagination queries. Change collection variables to try other values. Arbitrary query values have infinitely many combinations, so the query folder provides composable examples rather than enumerating every value. Data is fetched from remote JSON files and write requests do not persist changes.",
